<speak>I'll set out what I have in mind together, rather than jumping between my notes. The fund I want for this transaction is Meridian Asia Equity Fund. The allocation of 1,000,000 in <sub alias="you ess">US</sub> dollars was just a hypothetical illustration, not my transaction amount. My overall personal investment account is valued at 1,200,000 in <sub alias="you ess">US</sub> dollars; that's the account valuation, not the amount for this order. Use <sub alias="you ess">US</sub> dollars as the transaction currency. The actual amount I'm committing to this transaction is 250,000. The quantity I want to transact is 1,000 units. I want to buy those units. Please place it as a market order.</speak>